      "sourceLink": null,
      "spam": false,
      "statusChangeID": null,
      "value": "I should mention that this also happens on Twitch. Can't even watch a livestream without both the audio and video desyncing from each other, and *also* two players desyncing between each other.\n\nIt seems the only thing that works is a plain web-hosted MP4 file, and even that will freeze and crash on occasion for random players.",
      "viewerReactions": null
