  "deletedAt": null,
  "details": "Audio delay on both stream sync and video sync gets worse over time. It's gotten bad enough that a \"Resync\" button is essential in any video player world.\n\nOther Canny posts on the issue claim that the problem is fixed in Unity 2017, this is definitely *not* the case.",
